+## Routes
+
+The complete route list is in [README](../README.md#routes).
+
+- `POST /import/sales`: send `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  Each row sells a positive whole number of portions at an ISO instant. Previously
+  imported tickets are skipped. Returns `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`,
+  counting newly imported tickets and portions. The entire file is atomic.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD`: returns an array
+  of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` for inclusive UTC days.
+  Difference is actual minus theoretical; theoretical quantities are captured
+  at sale import, and actual includes every consume movement.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
